  "details": "the stuff about action drivers made me think about this. right now if a creator wants to make a mechanical watch moving a mesh around, they need to provide an input via OSC. with shaders having access to the time, I think it makes sense to drive the mechanical watches without OSC.\n\nif the parameter is driven by the avatar wearer and then the parameter synced across the network, that would allow a user to share their own time. alternatively the parameters could be driven locally so that the viewer sees their own time.",
